# Copy to .envrc and run `direnv allow`. The real .envrc is gitignored, so
# anything you add here stays local to your checkout.
#
# Drops you into the devShell from flake.nix: go, gopls, staticcheck, and
# nixfmt.
#
# Optional: add the nix-direnv package to cache the evaluated shell. Without
# it this still works, it just re-evaluates the flake on the first `cd` after
# any change to the watched files below.
use flake

# Keep the shell from being rebuilt on unrelated edits.
watch_file flake.nix nix/package.nix
